    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01J0KF81HG8HV7HED93NJW033T\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to add a visible tag to all reviews that were incentivized (e.g., received a gift, discount, or sweepstakes entry in exchange for reviewing your product). </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J0KF81HGFYETVM12TWDVBQYB\">About review incentives</h2>\n<p>Review incentives are a great way to boost your review submission rate and add more reviews to your site. You can offer customers a small gift or thank you for their review, like: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>A discount or free shipping on their next order </li>\n<li>A gift</li>\n<li>Free product in exchange for honest reviews </li>\n<li>Entry into a giveaway or sweepstakes</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When offering incentives like these, or when the reviewer has a personal relationship with you or the brand, it’s a <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/16685026123035\">reviews best practice</a> to disclose the incentive on the review itself. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01J0KF81HG56WPB09EEW1EQ3D2\">Disclosing review incentives</h2>\n<p>Klaviyo offers the option to indicate that a reviewer received an incentive for any submitted reviews. You can do this in 3 ways: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#h_01J0KF8RB2T2YR1H9C68EX68CD\">Manually mark individual reviews as incentivized.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#h_01J0KF9XWAFVQQPD5ABNX8N7V5\">Automatically mark reviews as incentivized using a flow. </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#h_01J0KFBSYA6NMEJMYJHRKFXBP4\">Generate an individual link to leave an incentivized review.</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Incentivized reviews appear with a small <em>Incentivized</em> tag and gift icon in reviews widgets. In certain contexts, only the gift item is visible. By hovering over the icon, a visitor can see what type of incentive the reviewer received.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28713386070171\" alt=\"An incentivized review\" width=\"714\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J0KF8RB2T2YR1H9C68EX68CD\">Manually mark a review as incentivized </h3>\n<p>You can manually mark a review as incentivized if you need to add the indicator to an existing review. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Reviews</strong> tab. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>All reviews</strong>. </li>\n<li>Search for the review you’d like to mark as incentivized. </li>\n<li>If the review is not already published, click <strong>Publish</strong>. Pending reviews cannot be marked as incentivized.</li>\n<li>Open the three dots menu and select <strong>Mark as incentivized</strong>.<br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28713386072603\" alt=\"The mark as incentivized button\" width=\"647\" height=\"136\">\n</li>\n<li>In the modal that appears, select the incentive the reviewer received. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Mark as incentivized</strong>. </li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J0KF9XWAFVQQPD5ABNX8N7V5\">Automatically mark reviews as incentivized using a flow </h3>\n<p>You can automatically mark future reviews as incentivized with a setting in the review request flow. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the <strong>Flows</strong> tab in Klaviyo. </li>\n<li>Open your review request flow. </li>\n<li>Click the card for any review request message that mentions an incentive. This will open the message sidebar. </li>\n<li>In the <em>Settings</em> section of the message sidebar, select <strong>Enable UTM Tracking</strong>. </li>\n<li>Select the option <strong>Use custom tracking parameters</strong>.</li>\n<li>Check <strong>Mark reviews as incentivized</strong> and select an incentive type. <br>\n\n<img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/28713375148315\" alt=\"The option to mark reviews as incentivized in a flow\" width=\"274\" height=\"591\">\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Save</strong>. </li>\n<li>Repeat these steps for any other messages in the flow that reference an incentive. </li>\n<li>Click <strong>Publish flow</strong> to set your changes live. </li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"h_01J0KFBSYA6NMEJMYJHRKFXBP4\">Generate an individual link to leave an incentivized review </h3>\n<p>If you’re offering an incentive to a review outside of your flow, send them an incentivized review link. </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Reviews &gt; Products</strong>. </li>\n<li>Opening a product’s additional options menu.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Copy incentivized link to review</strong>.</li>\n</ol>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
